---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms governing your use of ReddTools — free online tools provided as-is, without warranty.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 11 August 2026</p>

    <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
    <p>By using reddtools.com ("ReddTools", "we", "us"), you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

    <h2>What we provide</h2>
    <p>ReddTools offers free online utility tools including calculators, converters, counters, timers, and colour pickers. All tools run entirely in your browser. We do not guarantee the accuracy, reliability, or completeness of any tool's output.</p>

    <h2>No professional advice</h2>
    <p>The calculators and converters on this site are provided for informational purposes only. They are not financial, legal, tax, or professional advice. Do not make financial or other important decisions based solely on results from these tools. Consult a qualified professional for advice specific to your situation.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose</li>
      <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or gain unauthorised access to the site</li>
      <li>Use automated systems (bots, scrapers) in a way that degrades service for others</li>
      <li>Reproduce or redistribute the site's design or content without permission</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The ReddTools name, logo, design, and source code are owned by Redd Group. Tool functionality is client-side and freely usable on this website. You may not copy, redistribute, or rebrand the site.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>ReddTools is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent permitted by law, Redd Group shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site, including but not limited to inaccurate calculation results, loss of data, or business interruption.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>The site displays advertisements served by Google AdSense. We are not responsible for the content of advertisements or the products/services they promote. Clicking on ads is at your own discretion.</p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our use of analytics and advertising data is described in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Changes to terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about these terms, contact <a href="mailto:hello@secondread.me">hello@secondread.me</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 64px;
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .updated {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #999;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000;
    margin: 32px 0 8px;
  }
  .legal-page p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #5b5b5b;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .legal-page li {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #5b5b5b;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: #00c2ff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>